<title>USA: Continucare says it redeems 1.262 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Continucare says it redeems 1.262 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continucare Corp said Friday it has redeemed 1.262 million shares of its common stock at a discount to market price from two shareholders.</p>
<p>The company said the purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company said the purchase is for about 11 percent of its total shares outstanding.</p>
